Tiku Prompt (题库提示词)
Copyright (c) 2026 pchartming

Tiku Prompt is an offline prompt-generation tool. It assembles text prompts
locally and does not call an AI service, require an API key, or request network
access. It supports unofficial import compatibility with StudyOnTV / 题了个题,
PlanYourTV, 学习锁, and HaloTV; those names describe compatible import formats
and data provenance.

The bundled course catalog is derived from PlanYourTV's textbook catalog asset,
which is licensed under the MIT License:

  Copyright (c) 2026 pengchujin
  Copyright (c) 2026 PlanYourTV contributors

The catalog contains textbook, unit, and lesson titles only. It does not contain
textbook body text, images, question banks, answers, or third-party app assets.
The titles are compiled from the public curriculum catalog of the National Smart
Education Platform (国家中小学智慧教育平台, https://basic.smartedu.cn/).

PlanYourTV's source code is also available under the MIT License. Any reused
PlanYourTV code must retain the same copyright and permission notice.

StudyOnTV / 题了个题, 学习锁, and HaloTV are third-party applications. Their
names identify compatible import formats; compatibility is unofficial and may
break when those apps change.

Third-party dependencies and the full PlanYourTV MIT notice are listed in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. The project's own source is licensed under the MIT
License in LICENSE.
